{"time": 1757926345, "type": "reply", "message_id": "246911866", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "开始记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1757926369, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1881684510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "（克莱顿）"}
{"time": 1757926382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "65902083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "2012年12月17日，耶稣生辰未至，却已经到处洋溢着圣诞节的氛围，红绿环绕的张灯结彩之下，是人们的欢声笑语。"}
{"time": 1757926453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1589212214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "但这堆服务业来说并不是好事情，临近假日意味更多的游客，繁华之下付出的是更多的精力。"}
{"time": 1757926554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2016485094", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "为了收入图书馆的营业时间调的更晚了，等到客人散尽，你在亮黄色的灯光之下整理书籍，回头过来已是深夜。"}
{"time": 1757926598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1462302434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "为了收入图书馆的营业时间调的更晚了，等到客人散尽，你在亮黄色的灯光之下来回行步，穿过翠绿色的塑料枝叶与大红色的蝴蝶夹，以整理书籍，回头过来已是深夜。"}
{"time": 1757926600, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1944953909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（到你）"}
{"time": 1757926691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1431711712", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "从文学书架上随机挑选一本冒险小说"}
{"time": 1757926812, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1959362603", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "你随便拿了一本轻小说，书中的主角依靠时间穿越的能力打败反派，拯救了世界。"}
{"time": 1757926866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "696654469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“时间穿越啊，如果我也能回到过去的话”"}
{"time": 1757927070, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1874869502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "突然，你接到了一个电话，是馆长打来的"}
{"time": 1757927187, "type": "recv", "message_id": "568792219", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“喂，是馆长吗？”"}
{"time": 1757927287, "type": "recv", "message_id": "277642583", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“嗯，这么晚打过来，没妨碍到你吧”"}
{"time": 1757927346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1733076581", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“没有没有，嗨，反正晚上回去也只是玩手机。倒不如在图书馆值班呢”"}
{"time": 1757927959, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1899573102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（草 原来你发消息了呀，没看到）"}
{"time": 1757927966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "607424076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1757927980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "695763472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（我以为你还没回（））"}
{"time": 1757928003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "704387161", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "（唉，你以为我是会优先在群里水群不跑团的人吗？）"}
{"time": 1757928014, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1324178975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（我错了）"}
{"time": 1757928046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "609253727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“朱蒂还记得不，朱蒂·康伯巴奇”"}
{"time": 1757928145, "type": "recv", "message_id": "738859622", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "思索了一下“是馆长你要好的朋友吧”"}
{"time": 1757928169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1088237985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "（设定上可以要求我见过朱蒂吗？）"}
{"time": 1757928180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1696345527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（你喜欢）"}
{"time": 1757928197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1688403844", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（你们想要熟悉到什么程度）"}
{"time": 1757928233, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1157535281", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“记得一年前馆长你还带着我和他一起去旅游，也已经很久没见过了”"}
{"time": 1757928396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "73187116", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“是呀，她的博物馆刚刚失窃了，报案找警察因为不值钱有很多案件为由不受理，想让我帮个忙找找。但我抽不开身你也知道，就问问你能不能帮下忙。”"}
{"time": 1757928498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "432248793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“当然没问题”"}
{"time": 1757928961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "913177142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“她说这个东西和什么，世界末日有关，所以时间紧迫她准备动身直接出发了，你要不直接去机场和她汇合？图书馆这边就不用担心了，我再安排其他人帮个忙”"}
{"time": 1757929031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "177480556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“现在吗？已经是深夜了”"}
{"time": 1757929102, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2091069341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“嗯，目的地是阿卡姆市，路程还是挺远的，就在车上补觉了”"}
{"time": 1757929170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1378822972", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“好的馆长，我现在收拾一下行李就出发”"}
{"time": 1757929380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "573877559", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“麻烦你咯，到时候圣诞节给你放个假”"}
{"time": 1757929393, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1644706326", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“没什么事的话我先挂咯？”"}
{"time": 1757929415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1928197544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“好”"}
{"time": 1757929482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1508569192", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“那晚安。......滴”传来了挂电话的声音"}
{"time": 1757929518, "type": "recv", "message_id": "143348606", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "收拾一下图书馆，闭馆后回家收拾行李，前往机场"}
{"time": 1757929751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1728381087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "机场候机厅，你很明显地认出了这位金发女士，时尚的蓝色衣装独具一格。但和你上年的记忆相比，明显憔悴了一些。"}
{"time": 1757929758, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1516522043", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=473DEEAF6ABAFFE1A5E174451B5F5BC6.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhShdtKfUUXtBMB1A1XntCGZSTDd_RjzwCAg_wookIDt1b7ajwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ5zowUtIRHiJFykbaXtFV_XoCNwqCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSMIhqy9KGIwvyfw9_EAT5mnUTcgkASAYbfCGS5rC4-Ti1u94RIK5QbyJyAGpxHgvICQ,file_size=532595]"}
{"time": 1757929767, "type": "recv", "message_id": "205971003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "（还有照片）"}
{"time": 1757929784, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1603321175", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "（我上次跑的时候怎么没有）"}
{"time": 1757929787, "type": "recv", "message_id": "869815959", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（小说也是70页模组）"}
{"time": 1757929792, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1187085014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（因为我懒得发）"}
{"time": 1757929878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2013253876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“你是布莱克是吧”显然，她也还记得你"}
{"time": 1757929907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1114908446", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“好久不见，朱蒂女士”"}
{"time": 1757929943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1604060533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“听说你的博物馆失窃了，真是不幸啊”"}
{"time": 1757929991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "243545619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“是呀...唉，还好你愿意来帮忙。”"}
{"time": 1757930422, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1176897490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“好巧不巧，我回去拿点东西刚好撞上东西失窃了，好险他漏了点东西我才知道他的行程。希望不会出什么事情才好。”"}
{"time": 1757930446, "type": "recv", "message_id": "13771531", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“漏了什么东西？”"}
{"time": 1757930543, "type": "recv", "message_id": "761845243", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“警察调查了时候发现了半张票据，上面是前往阿卡姆的机票信息”"}
{"time": 1757930617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1777391277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“阿卡姆啊，这个就是我们此行的目的地吗？”"}
{"time": 1757930701, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1256116609", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“嗯”"}
{"time": 1757930740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2042130633", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“听说这个还和世界末日有关”"}
{"time": 1757930755, "type": "recv", "message_id": "574233962", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“嗯，这个也算是我的猜测啦”"}
{"time": 1757930773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1481421648", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "说着，她表情变得严峻起来"}
{"time": 1757930788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "937554976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“你觉得我的博物馆，所代表的故事，是真实存在的吗”"}
{"time": 1757930866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2039403690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "歪一下头，并没有听懂"}
{"time": 1757930941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "102023315", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“简单说就是里面的物品并非故事，而是历史。但真实已经被遗忘了。”"}
{"time": 1757930986, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1319878954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“被丢失的物品叫做 星尘 ，是一个有着黑色光滑表面的椭圆形金属盒子”一边说着，她用手一边比划"}
{"time": 1757931030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "704267472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“是在瑞士莱辛巴赫瀑布夺下的战利品，由此才终结了最终犯罪。”"}
{"time": 1757931088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "251706761", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“最终犯罪是什么，至今无人知晓，但我担心，这会会和玛雅文明预言的世界末日对应”她叹了口气"}
{"time": 1757931366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1971646154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（今晚能不能跑完导入）"}
{"time": 1757931375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1512968497", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（能的话明天就正式开始了）"}
{"time": 1757931382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "987578955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "（可以）"}
{"time": 1757931422, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2031890712", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1043687847", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（那你动）"}
